  "intro": "The Single Marine Program (SMP) serves as the voice for single, unaccompanied Marines, Sailors, Geo Bachelors, and any other single active duty servicemember. This Program helps in identifying QOL concerns, developing QOL initiatives, and providing recommendations through advocacy, recreational activities, special events, and community involvement. This is a Program where you have fun, learn, socialize, and enjoy some cool trips and events!",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "ABOUT US",
      "level": 5,
      "markdown": "The Single Marine Program (SMP) serves as the voice for single, unaccompanied Marines, Sailors, Geo Bachelors, and any other single active duty servicemember. This Program helps in identifying QOL concerns, developing QOL initiatives, and providing recommendations through advocacy, recreational activities, special events, and community involvement. This is a Program where you have fun, learn, socialize, and enjoy some cool trips and events!\n\nCheck out our upcoming events/trips below."
    }
